    "text": "For three events, <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>(Exactly one of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;occurs)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi></math>(Exactly one of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;occurs)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi></math>(Exactly one of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;occurs) <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>(All the three events occur simultaneously) <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Then the probability that at least one of the events occurs, is:",
